(6928731, 1043604, 30861, '<td valign="top">That''s gotta be a coffee-mug 70-200mm, right? Canon doesn''t make a white shade, right? Tell me I''m right! But what about the CAMERA? Of COURSE you didn''t sacrifice a 7D for a virtual ribbon? It''s on a fishing line right? Tell me I''m right! TELL ME!<br/> <br/>Curiously, thjis could technically the worst image ever to ribbon in DPC, certainly in my time here. But I knew as soon as I saw it that it would ribbon, because it touches the horrifying spot within us where none of us want to linger. <br/> <br/>Congrats!</td>', 'That''s gotta be a coffee-mug 70-200mm, right? Canon doesn''t make a white shade, right? Tell me I''m right! But what about the CAMERA? Of COURSE you didn''t sacrifice a 7D for a virtual ribbon? It''s on a fishing line right? Tell me I''m right! TELL ME! Curiously, thjis could technically the worst image ever to ribbon in DPC, certainly in my time here. But I knew as soon as I saw it that it would ribbon, because it touches the horrifying spot within us where none of us want to linger.  Congrats!', '2012-12-10 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 0),
